    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0517" n="385" xml:id="pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Rumania)/6–2345:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 293<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Representative in Rumania </hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Melbourne</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Acting Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-23T12:00:00+02:00">June 23,
                            1945—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>430. The Brit political representative<anchor n="1" xml:id="d293-f1"/> and Mr.
                    Berry discussed the question of a possible peace treaty with Rumania before the
                    latter’s departure for the US (Dept’s 310, June 21<anchor n="2" xml:id="d293-f2"
                    />). Since he is scheduled to arrive in the US within a day or two of this
                    telegram it is felt that Dept may wish to gain Mr. Berry’s personal
                        views.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d293-f3"/> Rptd Moscow as 114 and London as
                    1.</p>
                <p>Upon Genl Schuyler’s return from an inspection trip in three days I will suggest
                    to him that he may wish to present his views by telegram reflecting his
                    experience upon the ACC.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d293-f4"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Melbourne</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
